TI  - SENCA-st: Integrating Spatial Transcriptomics and Histopathology with Cross Attention Shared Encoder for Region Identification in Cancer Pathology
PY  - 2026
T2  - Proceedings - 2026 IEEE/CVF Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision, WACV 2026
SP  - 3578
EP  - 3587
